[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 41585.87, "timestamp": "11:33:05", "text": "設定的話，你需要設定路由，還有一件事，就是路由設置，還有Vban等等。如果你用Vban，音訊傳輸會消耗大量數據，因為要把音訊從一台"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 41598.605, "timestamp": "11:33:18", "author": "@soulofswords", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/N5UGOOCkqJY6i3x846X2nx9EjZpP3SAIdAeuPAjxPPdNLWmO1Oi53_c__BkFrKVpJqviVQ07=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ahh, shit. that's way expensive here."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 41605.71, "timestamp": "11:33:25", "text": "電腦傳輸到另一台電腦，在後台運行的數據量很大，所以會有一點延遲。為了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 41612.31, "timestamp": "11:33:32", "text": "降低延遲，我把麥克風放在直播電腦上，這樣所有Discord功能也都放在"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 41617.935, "timestamp": "11:33:37", "author": "@soulofswords", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/N5UGOOCkqJY6i3x846X2nx9EjZpP3SAIdAeuPAjxPPdNLWmO1Oi53_c__BkFrKVpJqviVQ07=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "same here lowest plan possible"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 41627.07, "timestamp": "11:33:47", "text": "直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 41629.31, "timestamp": "11:33:49", "text": "電腦上，因為延遲低。玩遊戲的時候，我需要把握好時機，要知道，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 41636.746, "timestamp": "11:33:56", "text": "音訊傳輸到遊戲電腦時會有延遲，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 41638.946, "timestamp": "11:33:58", "text": "大概有幾分之一秒"}]